 "provenance_note": "Independently re-derived in closed form and cross-checked against the measured branch table: at dt=0.01 s both branches equal 1.5e-4 um at f=0.7 exactly, so the 0.7 is the true intersection and not an artifact of sampling the load at tenths.",
